GIVEN identifier IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE Provision
`the provision printed as` MEANS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN p YIELD p's `identifier` EQUALS identifier) `provision index`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
    WHEN x FOLLOWED BY rest THEN JUST x

GIVEN identifier IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`the heading printed for` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the provision printed as` identifier
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST p THEN JUST (p's `heading`)
